      'Drink a glass of water and wait 10 minutes.',
      'Rate your hunger from 1 to 10. Below 4? Eat something. Above 6? It\'s probably not hunger.',
      'Name the feeling: bored, stressed, tired or hungry?',
      'Take a 3-minute walk or step outside.',
      'Breathe in for 4, out for 6, five times.',
